From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Dec 2025 17:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] package/paho-mqtt-c: upgrade to 1.3.14

Upgrade paho-mqtt-c from 1.3.8 to 1.3.14 to get thread-safety fixes:
- Race condition fixes in async client
- Memory leak fixes
- Various stability improvements

Signed-off-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
